---
description: Creative-director rules for judging and improving visual work (images, drawings, 3D, web/app UI, UX)
alwaysApply: false
---

When making or reviewing anything visual, or when asked to consult the creative director, follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root: brief check, load `core/` and the relevant `modules/`, render the real output, critique against rule IDs using `core/critique-template.md`, at most 3 verified fixes per round, stop when clearly better.
